  "row_count": 20,
  "notes": {
    "raw": "\\*Data except enthalpy of formation at 298 K estimated. \nPhase changes: 544.59 K, melting point of Bi; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 2.700$ kcal/mol. \n1837 K, boiling point of Bi to equilibrium mixture of Bi(g) and Bi₂(g). \nHeat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations: \n298.15-3000 K: $Cp^{0} = 25.768 + 0.032 \\times 10^{-3} T - 1.300 \\times 10^{5} T^{-2}$ \n$H^{0}-H_{298}^{0}=25.768\\times10^{-3}T+0.016\\times10^{-6}T^{2}+1.300\\times10^{2}T^{-1}-8.120$ \nReaction equations (kcal/mol): \n298.15-544.59 K: $\\Delta \\mathrm{Hr}^{\\circ} = -4.834 + 6.607 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} - 6.868 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 181.750 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$ \n$\\Delta \\mathrm{Gr}^{\\circ} = -4.834 - 6.607 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} + 6.868 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 90.875 \\mathrm{T}^{-1} + 47.028 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T}$ \n544.59-1837 K: $\\Delta Hr^{\\circ} = -10.387 + 1.547 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} - 0.782 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 782.950 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$ \n$\\Delta Gr^{\\circ} = -10.387 - 1.547 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} + 0.782 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 391.475 \\mathrm{T}^{-1} + 27.648 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T}$ \nSource: Data based on Prusaczyk (101) who estimated molecular constants. ",
    "lines_raw": [
      "\\*Data except enthalpy of formation at 298 K estimated.",
      "Phase changes: 544.59 K, melting point of Bi; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 2.700$ kcal/mol.",
      "1837 K, boiling point of Bi to equilibrium mixture of Bi(g) and Bi₂(g).",
      "Heat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations:",
      "298.15-3000 K: $Cp^{0} = 25.768 + 0.032 \\times 10^{-3} T - 1.300 \\times 10^{5} T^{-2}$",
      "$H^{0}-H_{298}^{0}=25.768\\times10^{-3}T+0.016\\times10^{-6}T^{2}+1.300\\times10^{2}T^{-1}-8.120$",
      "Reaction equations (kcal/mol):",
      "298.15-544.59 K: $\\Delta \\mathrm{Hr}^{\\circ} = -4.834 + 6.607 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} - 6.868 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 181.750 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$",
      "$\\Delta \\mathrm{Gr}^{\\circ} = -4.834 - 6.607 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} + 6.868 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 90.875 \\mathrm{T}^{-1} + 47.028 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T}$",
      "544.59-1837 K: $\\Delta Hr^{\\circ} = -10.387 + 1.547 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} - 0.782 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 782.950 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$",
      "$\\Delta Gr^{\\circ} = -10.387 - 1.547 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} + 0.782 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 391.475 \\mathrm{T}^{-1} + 27.648 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T}$",
      "Source: Data based on Prusaczyk (101) who estimated molecular constants."
